    {
      "text": "Hariyama practices its straight-arm slaps in any number of locations. One hit of this Pokémon’s powerful, openhanded, straight-arm punches could snap a telephone pole in two.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "Hariyama’s thick body may appear fat, but it is actually a hunk of solid muscle. If this Pokémon bears down and tightens all its muscles, its body becomes as hard as a rock.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "It is known for its fantastic strength, but as it grows older, it focuses more on training Makuhita.",
      "version": "sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "They love to compare their freakish strength— strength enough to send a truck flying with a single slap.",
      "version": "moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "Although they enjoy comparing their strength, they’re also kind. They value etiquette, praising opponents they battle.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "Hariyama that are big and fat aren’t necessarily strong. There are some small ones that move nimbly and use moves skillfully.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    }
